{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "5cc81f2a63c1557780050b7c1e1ef94a9d481e2aa82fe562300da31aa9417e10", "ja": "憧れのスタートライン", "zh": "憧憬的起跑线", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e59803979aee2c1ab0e371cfe5c8c59f48483407467ff1bd80eb600e6322b662", "ja": "CM撮影後半、海美は底知らずの元気で撮影\nをこなし、チームの仲間がいるといくらでも\n元気になれると笑う。海美は女子力全開の\nアイドルになれた喜びを噛み締めつつ、\nプロデューサーにお礼を言うのだった。", "zh": "广告拍摄后半段，海美带着深不见底的活力完成了\n拍摄，并笑着说只要有团队的伙伴在，自己就能要\n多少活力就有多少。海美细细体会着能够成为女子力全开的\n偶像的喜悦，同时向制作人道了谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "4e6abf00ffe19805f8e78579f877e0b7d8f1f06f1cdd19932125d45bb25e186c", "ja": "CM撮影　後半……", "zh": "广告拍摄　后半……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "aff7d9201f125860ebc428424aa49a0016cd83581e4d5de18efd864e49c2ea3b", "ja": "プロデューサー、大変！　どうしよう～！？", "zh": "制作人，不好了！怎么办呀～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "3ae7e853825d4dca65beb2a08e06116fd2a68036f1147392c55115d63ebb6f1c", "ja": "え？　どうした海美、なにが大変なんだ？", "zh": "咦？怎么了，海美，什么事这么不得了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "bb8c50f79624f8e83a1a03664fe2516ed5b2675105acc69ecf2ec6e46f958b7b", "ja": "あのね、息が切れないの！", "zh": "那个，我不会喘气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194", "ja": "……えっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "2e8c8e0e34d9aa8e63b3de4c803f1f801fe5fefe5cb7093eb04fd66d449d8916", "ja": "「必死に走ってきて、息を切らしながら一言！」\nって監督さんに言われたんだけど、全然切れなくて～。", "zh": "导演跟我说“拼命跑过来，气喘吁吁地说一句台词！”，\n但我根本喘不上气来呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "758a54d9c2e3786ad683ecc0d6e7ab0781365c5faa34aabe60dd3598c0e0da69", "ja": "な、なるほど。それは困ったな……。\nあ、撮影前に息が切れるまで走っておくとか、どうだ？", "zh": "原、原来如此。那可就伤脑筋了……  \n啊，要不在拍摄前先跑到气喘吁吁为止？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "3a4bac9c7dda86e475aee117967b1157a27d8168963d73e653d7ac4f908de099", "ja": "いいかも！　早速やってみるね！\nプロデューサー、ありがとー！", "zh": "这个主意不错！我马上就去试试！\n制作人，谢谢你——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "69b407b1eb837e1672a90a9cf1cac89b67cbe36b9e76cc96e256fc812222086b", "ja": "それじゃ☆\nうみみーん・全力ダーーーーッシュ！！", "zh": "那就这样☆\n海美——全力冲刺——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "c9da5497885f252466479cae1559a21e21f3909160ccd22b79fc5a0f42cea730", "ja": "はやっ。\n……足元、気をつけるんだぞー！", "zh": "好快。\n……小心脚下啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1010_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "e6566a842d5a3e6e2136b56120e58b6d49c73f1091565c56d42954e1ac58d620", "ja": "はあ、はあ、お疲れさま～！\n撮影、バッチリだったよ！　すごい～！！", "zh": "呼、呼……辛苦啦～！\n拍摄非常顺利！太厉害啦～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "ff93c9a38b9d88e9f522c3295bb97fba7183c67e4386e9c94c7b0bf2433bd43e", "ja": "お疲れさま！　すごいのは海美だよ。\nまさか、見えなくなるまで走っていくとはな……。", "zh": "辛苦啦！厉害的是海美才对。\n没想到你居然一直跑到看不见为止……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "16a097814298860e8ec4a679e374629a54c49d2c62cc503ba4b701cd0a7d9ef2", "ja": "えへへ……。私、体力には自信あるからね♪\nとくに今は、あれくらい走らないと意味ないし！", "zh": "嘿嘿……我的体力可是很有自信的哦♪\n尤其是现在，不跑到那种程度就没有意义嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "520fe99ef33f50e66df35b5197c906b97ce0b0d1950377bc66e3e30dc31cd2c8", "ja": "すごいな。どうして意味ないんだ？", "zh": "真厉害。为什么不跑那么多就没意义呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "9eac2a9b889c7565211c03d73c5d9fc5cfbde0e3d7bd191fb9e89a689506beb9", "ja": "えっとね、Team2ndのみんなと一緒にいるのが\n楽しくて！　元気がどんどん湧いて来ちゃうんだ♪", "zh": "那个……因为和Team2nd的大家待在一起很开心！精神一下子就源源不断地涌出来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "ab56b285bb42b3414b1e13e267669118c1f3e6a918404f7da48d02dc177ab1bd", "ja": "ほら、もう息も整ったよ！\nううう、早く次のシーン撮りたーい☆", "zh": "看，呼吸已经平稳下来了！\n呜呜，好想快点拍摄下一个场景啊☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "8c4c358384f85232074f158cd0fadd8d690d325d3de7dfa16bb9fa512405154d", "ja": "ははっ、なるほど。……楽しめてるのはいいけど、\n一応、遊びじゃないからな？", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。……能享受其中是好事，不过，毕竟不是在玩闹啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "7c240a6ae57a0b7d1be6e6506a34c22e3c269534e6306337497df5e8ba791790", "ja": "うんっ、だからね。\nだから……とっても、嬉しいの！", "zh": "嗯，所以啊。\n所以……我真的特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "8297ee73d8950f9b1f6b8936c4fb67e37c612313f7dede053b11791fe76df25a", "ja": "私が、本当にアイドルになれたってことだから。\nキラキラでカワイイ、女子力いっぱいの……。", "zh": "这说明，我真的成为偶像了呢。\n闪闪发光、可爱迷人，充满少女魅力的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "577334aaaf8d7b3f75be725602f27bf5b79242101d69a677ba50fd1cce9b7b09", "ja": "そんなアイドルに、私が……！\nえへっ、えへへへへ～～～☆", "zh": "那样的偶像，我居然……！\n嘿嘿，诶嘿嘿嘿嘿～～～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "d0020dbd74c75410d754b06cfa9bc44e6653206aa7f3a7b83dc3925145309ce6", "ja": "……そっか。\nうん、そうだよな。", "zh": "……这样啊。\n嗯，确实是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1023_401pro", "source_sha256": "8c2308887902bff86f3a2f59daf104e92c7bfdad81a7066a77be9fb23156b845", "ja": "そういえば、この仕事は楽しむのが一番大事だ。\nその調子で、最後まで楽しんでいこう！", "zh": "说起来，享受这份工作才是最重要的。\n就保持这个状态，一直开心到最后吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "8b4ab4e6dc08337f94e47f3acde926d72fe5d2ce33b0920cf4478d025729fef5", "ja": "うんっ！　それじゃ、つぎの撮影行ってくるね！\nまた後でね、プロデューサー！　バイバーイ！", "zh": "嗯！那我去进行下一场拍摄啦！\n待会儿见，制作人！拜拜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "5d1db621f520ad83a53f36e3c2f46b6833b432ad25d4bf747627d11b9f82868c", "ja": "あ、あとあとっ！\nこれも言わなきゃって思ってたんだけどっ！", "zh": "啊，对了对了！\n我还想着，这个也一定要说才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_05_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "b118f624a1c67408a2c28fd3025765f0d7c417b1b18aa615afc6ac8c257ab328", "ja": "私をアイドルにしてくれて、ありがとっ☆\n……えへへっ！", "zh": "谢谢你让我成为偶像☆……嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
